  "fullDescription": "✈️ Travel Planner Bundle\n\nPlan, organize, and document your adventures with this all-in-one Travel Planner Bundle. Whether you’re heading on a weekend getaway or a month-long journey, this planner helps you manage everything from budgeting and packing to daily journaling and itinerary tracking.\n\n🔑 Key Features:\n\n🗂️ Trip Overview & Itinerary:\n\n📍 Trip Summary – Record destination, travel dates, and key trip info in one place.\n🛫 Transportation Details – Track flights, trains, terminals, seat numbers, and travel times.\n🏨 Accommodation Log – Note hotel names, check-in/out dates, addresses, and guest ratings.\n📅 Daily & Weekly Itinerary – Plan your days hour-by-hour with slots for weather, meals, and activities.\n✏️ Multi-Trip & Vacation Summary – Manage multiple trips with overview pages for each journey.\n\n💵 Budget & Expenses:\n\n💰 Travel Budget Planner – Compare estimated vs. actual costs across all categories.\n🧾 Expense Tracker – Log each purchase with date, description, and cost.\n🚗 Transportation Budget – Plan and track spending on flights, cars, trains, and more.\n🍴 Food, Activities & Stay Budgets – Break down costs for meals, entertainment, and accommodations.\n📝 Budget Notes – Add comments, adjustments, or payment details for better clarity.\n\n✅ Checklists & Planning:\n\n📦 Packing Lists – Organized by month-before, week-before, and day-of travel needs.\n📅 Pre-Trip Checklists – Ensure nothing is missed before departure.\n🛍️ To-Do & To-Buy Lists – Keep all preparation tasks and travel shopping in check.\n🔍 Destination Research – Brainstorm places to visit, foods to try, cultural or adventurous activities.\n🗺️ Trip Bucket List – Plan dream experiences and must-see sights for future travels.\n\n📓 Journaling & Memories:\n\n🗒️ Daily Travel Journal Pages – Reflect on each day of your trip with space for writing and memories.\n📸 Noteworthy Moments – Record your favorite memory, best photo opportunity, funniest moment, and more.\n🧭 My Destination Notes – Capture quick notes about each place you visit.\n🌍 Travel Bucket List – List your dream destinations, foods to try, and experiences to have.\n🧠 Pros & Cons of Each Stay – Evaluate how each accommodation supported your rest and recharge.\n\n🖨️ File Info:\n\n📐 Sizes: US Letter (8.5×11″), (6×9)\n🏠 Print at home or professionally\n💾 Instant Digital Download – Use Forever\n🛠️ Canva template – fully editable\n📄 print-ready pdf\n🖼️ high-quality jpg\n🧷 transparent Png\n📘 40 page layouts\n🖨️ professional specs – 300 dpi, no bleed\n\n📝 Note for You:\n\nThanks so much for checking out this product! If it brings value to your journey, be sure to explore the rest of my shop for more tools to inspire mindfulness, creativity, and growth. 💛",
